  "txn_values":    ["None", "Muxed", "Dedicated"],

  "notes": [
    "sku identifiers are Blues part numbers with '-' replaced by '_' (C++ identifier rules).",
    "Multiple hardware revisions of the same part number are disambiguated with a _V{maj}_{min} suffix.",
    "MCU rule supplied by Blues: revision 1.x → STM32L4; revision 2.x → STM32U5xxx unless otherwise identified. Exceptions are NOTE-ESP (ESP32-S3) and NOTE-LORA (STM32WL / STM32WLE5).",
    "TxnPinSupport.None  — no CTX/RTX pins exposed. Handshake compiles out.",
    "TxnPinSupport.Muxed — available via AUX2/AUX3 after card.aux configuration.",
    "TxnPinSupport.Dedicated — always-available dedicated pins.",
    "Unverified SKUs default to txn='Unknown' until a datasheet spot-check confirms them."
  ],

